# 15. Kubernetes Basics

---

## Pod

Smallest deployable unit.

Contains container.

Example:

```text
Question Service Pod
```

---

## Deployment

Manages pods.

Responsibilities:

```text
Create pods
Restart failed pods
Rolling update
Scaling
```

---

## Service

Stable network endpoint.

Without service:

Pod IP changes.

Service gives fixed DNS:

```text
mysql
question-service
quiz-service
```

---

## Namespace

Logical grouping.

Example:

```yaml
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: microservices
```

Separates:

```text
dev
test
prod
```

---

## Secret

Stores sensitive data.

Example:

```yaml
MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD
```

