# 28. Common Problems

## ImagePullBackOff

Reason:

```text
Image not on Docker Hub
```

Fix:

```bash
docker push ...
```

---

## Connection Refused

Reason:

```text
localhost used inside container
```

Fix:

Use service names:

```text
mysql
service-registry
```

---

## Old Image Running

Fix:

```yaml
imagePullPolicy: Always
```

Then:

```bash
kubectl delete pod -l app=quiz-service -n microservices
```

---

## Gateway Routing Error

Cause:

Eureka hostname registration issue.

---

